{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c8e3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0d3-448d-7fa1-9a80-daada0956017"},"sequence":716,"recorded_at":1780531400001427,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0d5-0ec7-7ac0-9d87-2e4565923ebf"},"task_id":"01a0b0d5-0ec7-7ac0-9d87-2e4565923ebf","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0d5-0ec7-7ac0-9d87-2e4565923ebf","chunk":"Read text file `internal/clonebundle/errors.go`.\n1|package clonebundle\n2|\n3|import (\n4|\t\"errors\"\n5|\t\"fmt\"\n6|)\n7|\n8|// ErrInvalid is the refusal for every malformed clone-bundle input:\n9|// unknown or missing members, out-of-vocabulary values, broken\n10|// bounds, unsorted or duplicate order, digest disagreement, and\n11|// excluded-path admission. Callers match with errors.Is; the message\n12|// names the offending member.\n13|var ErrInvalid = errors.New(\"clonebundle: invalid clone bundle object\")\n14|\n15|func invalid(format string, arguments ...any) error {\n16|\treturn fmt.Errorf(\"%w: %s\", ErrInvalid, fmt.Sprintf(format, arguments...))\n17|}","final_result":true}}}
