: N-unknown-complete: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly small unknown-class manifests as complete; the 4-item killer derives true.\\nok: N-excluded-exact: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly superset excluded_classes; missing classes still refuse.\\nok: N-proof-identity: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly closed_store with an identity; provider_quiescence still refuses one.\\nok: N-core-only: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly non-core unstable with generation g, the killer's generation.\\nok: N-g2-generation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly generation-9 unstable archives to the target branch; every other unstable still refuses.\\nok: N-main-count: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly multi-main sessions at both build and decode sites; zero-main still refuses.\\nok: N-synth-operation: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly synthesized evidence with neither native event nor operation, the killer's shape.\\nok: N-blob-size: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly off-by-one size claims; every other disagreement still refuses.\\nok: N-self-digest: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the forged self digest sha256('forged'); every other mismatch still refuses.\\nok: N-descriptor-claim-agreement: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the forged descriptor claim at the agreement site only; the install site keeps its own row.\\nok: N-install-site-claim: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the forged descriptor claim at the install site only; the agreement site keeps its own row.\\nok: N-descriptor-id-link: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the killer's mismatched descriptor ID; every other mismatch still refuses.\\nok: N-extension-number: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly 2^53; every other unsafe literal still refuses.\\nok: N-extension-nested-dup: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly a duplicate nested member named a; every other duplicate still refuses.\\nok: N-extension-keys: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly extensions carrying a no-dots key; every other bad key still refuses.\\nERROR: N-capture-items-dup-decode: patch anchors 0, want 1\\nok: N-sorted-digests-dup: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the killer's duplicated digest pair through the delegating wrapper; every other duplicate still refuses.\\nok: N-sorted-strings-dup: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the killer's duplicated string pair through the delegating wrapper; every other duplicate still refuses.\\nok: N-rawrefs-dup-decode: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly an equal raw_ref duplicate at decode; unsorted refs still refuse.\\nok: N-decode-item-class: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly class mystery at decode; every other unknown class still refuses.\\nok: N-decode-actor-main-parent: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly actor[0] main-with-parent at decode; every other main-with-parent still refuses.\\nok: N-decode-evidence-status: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly capture_status maybe at decode; every other unknown status still refuses.\\nok: N-decode-event-visibility: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly visibility secret at decode; every other unknown visibility still refuses.\\nok: N-verify-descriptors-skip-0: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly a disagreeing descriptor at entry 0; every other entry still verifies.\\nok: N-reconcile-rawkeys-dup: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the killer's duplicated raw key; every other duplicate still refuses.\\nok: N-identity-rededecode: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly an undecodable identity of kind bogus; every other undecodable identity still refuses.\\nok: N-plan-item-match: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly the killer's extra plan candidate; every other items/plan mismatch still refuses.\\nok: N-block-xor: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly a block with neither content nor descriptor; a block with both still refuses.\\nok: N-maximal-incomplete: KILLED (want KILLED) :: Admits exactly incomplete known-class manifests to maximal_safe; unknown still blocks.\\nok: C-doc-comment: SURVIVED (want SURVIVED) :: Harmless control: a comment-only edit must survive.\\nHARNESS_EXIT:0\\n      37\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5002,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1251,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
