{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d811","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0d3-448d-7fa1-9a80-daada0956017"},"sequence":2659,"recorded_at":1780531400005313,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b0eb-3640-72b2-8fb2-fda29038895b"},"task_id":"01a0b0eb-3640-72b2-8fb2-fda29038895b","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b0eb-3640-72b2-8fb2-fda29038895b","chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 86-90\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-## Stated bounds (sibling scope)\n-\n-- Per-kind Canonical Event payload fact registries beyond the\n-  Section 13.14.1 envelope enforced in `checkPayload` (normalization\n-  sibling).\n+## Stated bounds (sibling scope)\n+\n+- Non-message Canonical Event payload member values past the\n+  envelope: `checkPayload` enforces strict objects and content-block\n+  rules, but per-kind fact values (including their numbers) are the\n+  normalization sibling's registry. Only `extensions` members carry\n+  the AX value model here.\n+- `-0` and leading-`+`/leading-zero integer literals in extension\n+  values admit, exactly as `canonicaljson.validateAXNumbers`\n+  admits them (`strconv.ParseInt` parity); the model refuses\n+  fractions, exponents, and magnitudes at or beyond 2^53.\n+- `BoundaryInput.Core` is caller-asserted; the real unstable-archive\n+  protection is `RefuseUnstableForTarget` at target admission.\n+- `InstallRawBlob`'s `blob_id`/`size` member-parse arms repeat the\n+  owner grammar after `CalculateObjectIdentity` already enforced\n+  it (`validateBlobDescriptor` requires digest `blob_id` and uint53\n+  `size`): defense in depth, unreachable on failure, pinned by the\n+  owner suite; the install negatives pin the claim comparison and\n+  the store size/digest enforcement end to end.\n+- Per-kind Canonical Event payload fact registries beyond the\n+  Section 13.14.1 envelope enforced in `checkPayload` (normalization\n+  sibling).\n","final_result":true}}}
