{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e1f3","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b0d3-448d-7fa1-9a80-daada0956017"},"sequence":3924,"recorded_at":1780531400007843,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"f02750e1-95aa-4722-a114-f72ebe5c150a"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Handed off to review. Rework rev3 for TASK-260830-24z2b3 is complete — all 16 review findings answered, candidate left uncommitted in the Story worktree on current base `888ae3d`.\n\n**What changed (rev3 delta over rev2):**\n- **P1-a** — `VerifyDescriptorAgreement` now takes the entry's `blob_descriptor_id` and refuses verified bytes that aren't the descriptor the entry names, at both `buildRawEntries` and `VerifyRawManifestDescriptors`.\n- **P1-b** — New `checkExtensionsClosed` gate at all 16 admission sites: recursive AX number-model validation (integer literals, |n| ≤ 2⁵³−1, no fraction/exponent, duplicate-free at every depth, mirroring `canonicaljson.validateAXNumbers`), enforced at Build and Decode.\n- **P2-f/P2-a** — Scalar gates are now one-line `environ` delegates (sessadapter convention); string measure is characters, with `TestMultibyteStringMeasure` (300-char/600-byte admit, 512/513 edges).\n- **P2-b/P2-c** — Decode-side negatives for every surviving row; new `TestVerifyRawManifestDescriptorsRefusals` and `TestInstallRawBlobRefusals`; `N-descriptor-claim` split per site; `N-exclusion-config` is now a true narrowing; harness writes one raw log per plant (`--log-dir`).\n- **P2-d/P2-e** — Duplicate raw keys refused outright; `IdentityDigest` re-decodes before hashing.\n- **P3** — Content-block XOR enforced; one-per-plan-candidate refused at build; sanitizer hardened (C1, Cf/Zl/Zp, case-folded marker, schemeless userinfo) with the exact bound stated; Core-nominal bound stated; LOGBOOK sentence fixed; dead code removed.\n\n**Evidence (all attached, checklist 19/19):**\n- Full 27-command suite green on the final tree: `go test ./...` (38 ok), `-race -timeout 25m` (38 ok, no DATA RACE), `-cover`, 14 fuzz smokes, tracecheck, cataloggen, cross-builds, plus package suite at 83.9%.\n- Mutant battery: 36 KILLED + 1 SURVIVED control, full battery run twice with per-plant raw logs and exits; `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`, no `__pycache__`.\n- `TASK-260830-24z2b3_results.md` (finding-by-finding table), `TASK-260830-24z2b3_conformance-matrix.md` (18 of 18 AC rows driven), `TASK-260830-24z2b3_producer-evidence.tar.gz` (verified gzip, 96 files).\n\nOne honest note (also in results.md): a comment-only doc fix landed after commands 4–6; the final tree was re-verified (package suite, vet, gofmt, diff-check, affected mutant rows all green).","reason":null}}
